# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card and button is said
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Machine page: Density 50, Drift 6 bars, Filter 46, Echo 60. Preset Dub Chamber, F minor 7, tempo 118, playing
listen
where
said Loops Kick 16, Hats 12, Perc 7, Stab 10, Bass 16, Bleep 5
tap ENV
wait 300
said Mix page: Drums 70, Stab 70, Bass 70, Bleep 60
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Tempo 118, Key F, USB level Master, Lights On
spin K3 1
wait 300
said USB level Full
spin K3 -1
wait 300
tap FX
wait 300
said Space page: Swing 8%, Echo time 3/16, Reverb 40, Duck 45
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/4
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K2 -50
wait 300
said Drift Held
tapkey w2
said MUTED Perc
tapkey w2
said UNMUTED Perc
turn ALGO 1
said KEY F#
turn ALGO -1
said KEY F
turn PRESET 1
said PRESET Warehouse, A minor, tempo 126
turn PRESET -1
said PRESET Dub Chamber
tap REC
said HOLD ON
tap REC
said HOLD OFF
tap EDIT
said MUTATE
tap PLAY
said STOPPED
wait 300
unsaid PLAYING
tap PLAY
said PLAYING
press OCT+
wait 1000
said OCT+ button. THE NEXT PRESET
release OCT+
speakdump
